\": \"New Copilot Chat Features GA\",\n    \"description\": \"Several new Copilot chat features became generally available on July 9, 2025, including instant previews, flexible editing, issue management, improved attachments, and model selection capabilities.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2025-08-07-github-copilot-in-vs-code-july-release-v1-103/\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-07-09\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    \"title\": \"Agent Mode Expansion\",\n    \"description\": \"Agent mode reached general availability across multiple IDEs including JetBrains, Eclipse, and Xcode (previously available in VS Code). Agent mode is an autonomous AI agent that can research repositories, create plans, make code changes, and allow review of diffs.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://github.blog/changelog/2025-08-07-github-copilot-in-vs-code-july-release-v1-103/\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-07-09\",\n    \"community_feedback\": [\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"GitHub Copilot's new agent mode is capable of iterating on its own code, recognizing errors, and fixing them automatically\",\n        \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"quote\": \"Many people using it because companies 'auto bought it' (classic Microsoft strategy)\",\n        \"source\": \"Hacker News\",\n        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    \"title\": \"Version 0.39 Release\",\n    \"description\": \"Released Claude Code v0.39 with new Active Time metric in OpenTelemetry logging and Claude Code hooks for custom automation workflows.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    \"url\": \"https://www.claudelog.com/claude-code-changelog/\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-07-02\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  }\n]",
